# DAX Measures

This document contains the DAX measures used by the Semantic Model and Power BI dashboard.

---

## Total Orders

```DAX
Total Orders = COUNT(Fact_Shipping_Performance[Order_ID])
```

Description

Calculates the total number of orders.

---

## On-Time Delivery Rate

```DAX
On-time Delivery Rate = VAR Total = [Total Orders] VAR OnTime = CALCULATE(COUNT(Fact_Shipping_Performance[Order_ID]), Fact_Shipping_Performance[Delivery_Status] = "On-Time") RETURN DIVIDE(OnTime, Total, 0)
```

Description

Calculates the percentage of orders delivered on time.

---

## Delayed Orders

```DAX
Delayed Orders = CALCULATE(COUNT(Fact_Shipping_Performance[Order_ID]), Fact_Shipping_Performance[Delivery_Status] = "Delayed")
```

Description

Calculates the total number of delayed orders.
